        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sister, Sister (1982 film), The Omega Man\n- People: Diahann Carroll, Rosalind Cash, Irene Cara, Charlton Heston\n- Places: Old Ship African Methodist Episcopal Zion Church\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, Rosalind Cash played Lisa, the love interest of Charlton Heston's character, in the science fiction film The Omega Man.\n- In 1982, Sister, Sister was released as an American drama television movie.\n- In 1982, Sister, Sister starred Diahann Carroll, Rosalind Cash, and Irene Cara.\n- In 1982, scenes from the television movie Sister, Sister were shot at Old Ship African Methodist Episcopal Zion Church.",
